==== <span class="anchor" id="Claim of notability"></span> Assertions of a topic's notability ====
{{shortcut|WP:AINOTABILITY}}
Whereas AI-generated articles [[WP:AITREND|emphasize their subject's impact]], AI-generated comments may exaggerate how notable that subject may be under Wikipedia's guidelines.

'''Examples'''
{{blockquote|{{fmbox|image=none|text=
The Pakistan Pharmacist Federation (PFF) is a well-established national organization in Pakistan, representing a significant and influential body of professionals in the pharmaceutical sector. The Federation plays an essential role in advocating for the pharmacy profession, advancing pharmaceutical education, and improving public health through various initiatives. Given its established presence, contributions to policy-making, and direct impact on the healthcare system, {{highlight|PFF qualifies as a notable entity under Wikipedia’s notability criteria for organizations}}.

[...]

{{highlight|Given the Pakistan Pharmacist Federation’s notability}} as a national organization with a significant role in public health and professional advocacy, and my commitment to revising the article to ensure it complies with Wikipedia’s editorial standards, I respectfully request that the speedy deletion nomination be reconsidered. I am confident that once revised, the article will meet Wikipedia’s requirements and provide valuable, neutral information about the Federation’s role in Pakistan’s pharmaceutical sector.

}}|From [[User talk:Tahanazir#c-Tahanazir-20250505232500-HelenDegenerate-2021-12-17T22:40:00.000Z|this May 2025 comment]] at [[User talk:Tahanazir]]}}

